{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/ReorderVars.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.reorderVars\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">reorderVars</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">force</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> := <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.false\">false</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Reorders the variables according to `cmp` when it pays off. Variables created after a\nreordering (e.g., by later E-matching rounds) are appended to the order, so an expensive\none may end up after the cheap ones it appears with, and the Cooper case splits that\neliminate it enumerate its coefficient. The first reordering applies the full order; a later\none is performed only when a variable with `cost₁ > 1` is out of place, so that cheap\nproblems do not accumulate epochs (see `State.varsHistory`). `force := true` reorders whenever\nthe order changes; it is used after a `requestReorder`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/ReorderVars.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.reorderVars","kind":"def","line":146,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.reorderVars","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/ReorderVars.lean#L146-L206"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tac